@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Open the real-time connection
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Member" as actor
box "Frontend — Popkin web app" #E0F2FE
  participant "Pages" as page
  participant "ThreadStore /\nUnreadTracker" as store
  participant "SignalRPopkinRealtime" as rt
end box
box "Backend — Popkin API" #D1FADF
  participant "PopkinHub" as hub
  participant "PresenceTracker" as presence
end box
box "Backend — Popkin Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "Application" as handler
end box
box "Backend — Popkin Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Popkin database" as db
end box
actor -> page : Signed-in app starts (shell app)
page -> rt : start()
rt -> hub : POST /hubs/popkin/negotiate, then WebSocket upgrade with session cookie
hub -> hub : [Authorize]; Origin must be the app's own origin
alt no valid session (L2-050 AC4)
  hub --> rt : 401
  rt --> page : state disconnected; app follows the sign-in rules
else valid session
  hub -> handler : Active memberships of the PersonId
  handler -> db : Membership where LeftAt is null
  db --> handler : Popkin ids
  hub -> hub : Groups.AddToGroupAsync(connection, "popkin:{popkinId}") per Popkin
  hub -> presence : Connected(popkinId, personId, connectionId)
  presence --> hub : hereNow per Popkin
  hub -> rt : PresenceChanged(popkinId, hereNow) to each popkin group
  rt --> page : state connected; header "14 members · 5 here now" (L2-021 AC1)
end
note over hub : Direct-message events go to Clients.Users(personA, personB) and need no group.\nA member who joins or leaves a Popkin is added to or removed from its group by that feature's handler.
@enduml
